 "_about": "Looks: tested combinations of fonts, colors, text styles and motion, so an edit looks designed from the first build. A spec uses one with \"look\": \"<name>\" (and \"brand\" for its colors). The builder adds the look's styles (title, accent, big, label, caption); styles in the spec with the same name override them key by key. Colors: $text, $accent and $muted are replaced by spec.brand, else by the look's own colors. Everything else here (cards, transitions, hit, filter, pace, music) is guidance for whoever writes the spec. All items are free CapCut resources.",
